    {
      "text": "because Jews have despised the Holy One, they shall be hated among all nations, 1 Ne. 19:14 (2 Ne. 6:10–11; 3 Ne. 16:9). hatred of Lamanites against Nephites, 2 Ne. 5:14 (Jacob 7:24; Enos 1:20). Gentiles have hated Jews and not sought to recover them, 2 Ne. 29:5. Lamanites are taught to hate children of God, Mosiah 10:17 (4 Ne. 1:39). the Lord visits iniquities of fathers upon children unto third and fourth generation of them that hate him, Mosiah 13:13 (Ex. 20:5). hatred of Lamanites against people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi becomes sore, Alma 24:1–2. teach everlasting hatred against sin and iniquity, Alma 37:32. converted Lamanites lay down their hatred, Hel. 5:51. tribes united in hatred of robbers, 3 Ne. 7:11. do good to them that hate you, 3 Ne. 12:43–44 (Matt. 5:43–44). man who serves two masters will hate one and love other, 3 Ne. 13:24 (Matt. 6:24). because of hatred, Lamanites put to death every Nephite who will not deny Christ, Moro. 1:2.",
